WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.250
(Thunder clapping)

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:08.333
(Gulps) Hmm?

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:14.917
Hmm?

00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:17.167
(Thunder clapping)

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:23.000
(Roaring)

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.333
(Mr Gruber) A guidebook to Peru.

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:31.292
Perhaps ignore the chapter
on "Zeppelin Travel".

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:36.875
Mr Brown?
Have you been seeing a ghost?

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.875
Mr Gruber, that statue...
What is it?

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.667
Ah, you've noticed my Peruvian collection.

00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:48.042
It just... roared.
Like it was speaking to me.

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:53.042
Things from my homeland
speak to me all the time.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.458
It was very strange, Mr Gruber.

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:59.875
Mr Brown, you know,
becoming a citizen of another country,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.792
while a wonderful thing,
can lead to... well, mixed feelings.

00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:13.750
Oh, not me, Mr Gruber.
My feelings are very much unmixed.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.583
But I will ask Aunt Lucy
about that statue.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.875
Reverend Mother, my nephew Paddington
is coming to visit,

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.125
completely out of the blue.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.917
Hallelujah!

00:01:28.042 --> 00:01:29.083
(Bell chimes)

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:32.500
Get ready, everyone.
He's coming.

00:01:34.542 --> 00:01:36.875
♪ Let's prepare for Paddington

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.958
♪ Paddington in Peru

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:41.250
♪ He's coming to stay from far away

00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:45.042
♪ And there's so much to do!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.458
♪ There's prepping and there's packing

00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:54.000
♪ No plan must be lacking...

00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:57.208
(Phoenix Buchanan's agent)
'Nice buns, by the way.'

00:01:57.792 --> 00:01:58.958
(Reverend Mother)
♪ There's no time for slacking

00:01:59.083 --> 00:01:59.917
♪ We'd better get cracking

00:02:00.042 --> 00:02:02.375
♪ And bring your nephew to you...

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.583
(Rings bell) Careful!

00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:05.667
♪ Let's prepare for Paddington

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.625
♪ Paddington in Peru

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.833
♪ Embarking today from the UK

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:12.167
♪ I pray that that they
won't suffer delays

00:02:12.292 --> 00:02:14.375
♪ There's lots and lots to do and see...

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.708
Can he get me some duty free?

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:21.083
♪ Everything must go with a swing
for Paddington in Peru

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.792
♪ Let's prepare for Paddington...

00:02:24.917 --> 00:02:28.625
Make sure your tray table
is securely stowed.

00:02:31.042 --> 00:02:34.542
Pull the red cord
to inflate your life jacket.

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.542
They didn't mean now, Paddington.

00:02:39.708 --> 00:02:41.042
I'm sorry.

00:02:41.542 --> 00:02:44.000
(Grunting)

00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:47.250
(Paddington) Hmm? Mmm.

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:48.875
Hmm? Mmm.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.667
- (Mr Brown) Paddington?
- Oh, sorry.

00:02:51.792 --> 00:02:55.625
♪ Let's prepare for Paddington...

00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:02.625
Oh...

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.917
Ah.

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:09.083
Welcome to Peru.

00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:12.792
(♪ "Paddington in Peru" continues
with Peruvian music arrangement)

00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:24.833
Nice view.

00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:26.125
Oh, yes.

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:29.208
(Mr Brown) Ooh...

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:40.208
Oh. Help yourself.

00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:42.458
- It's called marmalade.
- (Burps)

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.041
♪ His travel plans have been confirmed

00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:49.166
♪ No stone can be left unturned

00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:51.333
♪ Holy sisters, novice nuns

00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:53.500
♪ Action stations, everyone

00:03:53.625 --> 00:03:55.666
♪ There's pinning and tacking
and washing and stacking

00:03:55.791 --> 00:03:58.041
♪ Making and mending
and pruning and tending

00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:00.000
♪ And waxing and buffing
and plucking and stuffing

00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:02.166
♪ And slicing and dicing
and nightly de-licing

00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:04.458
♪ For Paddington

00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:09.583
♪ Paddington in Peru

00:04:19.417 --> 00:04:21.833
♪ Paddington in Peru ♪

00:04:39.542 --> 00:04:42.375
Oh... actual size.

00:04:46.167 --> 00:04:49.167
(Sniffing)

00:04:50.625 --> 00:04:51.625
Hmm?

00:04:57.625 --> 00:04:58.667
(Gasps)

